8
00:00:13.910 --> 00:00:17.121
Marque Visualizar CRM

9
00:00:17.122 --> 00:00:20.288
Marque Gerenciar cards

10
00:00:20.289 --> 00:00:23.657
Clique em Criar token

11
00:00:23.657 --> 00:00:24.313
